 "statement": "ChainDescent proof02: BOTH original434/435 gates pass EIGHT named roots0trusted and ALL EIGHT exact localPCCbindings pass. From norm-kernel description, Frobenius cube on2torsion, squared fixedness and equivariance, derives a rational2torsion correction by averaging; derives kernel membership from norm-half and dual identity. Full kernel transport proves half-choice independence and Frobenius-fixed output without assuming the desired beta or evaluator. HLP kernel identities, actual encoded fields/varieties/Frobenius/kernel transport, Picard/program/fixed-field descent remain explicit bridges. Original proof01 producer7roots0trusted and consumer absolute-path FAIL_build preserved separately; corrected02 adds the complete combined theorem and repo-relative gates. Native PhaseA f81cbf is separate; complete-chain execution/cost pending. Unsigned/no waiver or signed promotion."
